 way home in uncertain times this  airport served more than 38 million  passengers last year but now this is how  things look 40% of the workforce here  have been told to work from home while  the Health Ministry imposes strict  measures on the Qataris that are  returning from abroad and other  passengers who pass through for now what  is certain is that the effects of this  pandemic on the travel industry will be  felt for years to come Dora Jabari al  Jazeera Hamad International Airport Doha
 

